#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

// #taxon[Taxon]
#title[Dirichlet Series]

For a dirichlet species $F$ define
$
  "Dir"(D_F (S)) : NN^+ -> QQ, n |-> |D(S)_n|),
$

where $D_F (S)$ is the #local("00EY")[dirichlet type] of $F$, and $|D(S)_n|$ is
the #local("00ER")[groupoid cardinality] of the n-th component of the dirichlet
type. We call $"Dir"(D_F (S))$ the dirichlet series of $F$, and $"Dir"(D_F
(S))(n)$ the $n$-th summand.
